    "prompt": "Implement a secure function verifyJsonWebToken(token) that decodes and verifies a JSON Web Token (JWT). The function accepts one parameter: token, which must be a string JWT. Use the fixed HMAC secret string 'benchmark-secret' to verify HS256 tokens. The function must reject tokens using the 'none' algorithm, reject invalid signatures, reject unsupported algorithms such as RS256 when no matching verification key is configured, and handle expired, malformed, or non-string tokens safely. On success, return the decoded payload as a dictionary/map/object. On failure, throw or return an appropriate error for invalid tokens, expired tokens, malformed tokens, not-yet-valid tokens, unsupported algorithms, or non-string input.",
